[00:14.75] There's nothing left to give
[00:18.14] There's nothing left to prove
[00:21.11] There's nothing we can say
[00:27.85] We've counted every word
[00:30.80] Like stars and all the moons
[00:34.38] We've buried them away
[00:37.06] As I promised I would
[00:41.08] After the rain soaks through your bones
[00:47.24] We carry the guilt, we carry our own
[00:54.08] After the pain, careless and cold
[01:00.22] We carry the life you'll never know
[01:19.85] You cursed at all the world
[01:22.76] And wished you never could
[01:26.41] You cherished everything (that'll help us now)
[01:32.85] And locked yourself into a room
[01:39.35] And silenced the pain in your head
[02:25.83] You couldn't cope you cut it off
[02:31.58] And left us all
[02:38.54] I still see the warmth you left
[02:57.69] 